WEBVTT

01:30.870 --> 01:34.960
[Legend of the Magnate]

01:35.030 --> 01:37.900
[Episode 12]

01:43.870 --> 01:45.560
I almost forgot you're a princess.

01:45.560 --> 01:47.070
I wanted to give you a gift.

01:48.000 --> 01:48.870
I've been thinking about it,

01:48.870 --> 01:50.229
but couldn't decide what to pick.

01:50.229 --> 01:51.430
So I'll give

01:52.350 --> 01:54.039
Miss Bai, whom I've never met,

01:54.070 --> 01:54.800
a small gift.

01:57.170 --> 01:58.100
No need for that.

02:01.330 --> 02:02.280
I'm afraid I might not

02:02.280 --> 02:03.610
make it to your wedding.

02:04.000 --> 02:04.860
So giving it early

02:04.860 --> 02:06.120
can put my mind at ease.

02:06.310 --> 02:07.580
But I realized

02:08.110 --> 02:09.509
that with you by her side,

02:10.030 --> 02:10.960
she's already

02:11.790 --> 02:13.120
got the whole world.

02:13.120 --> 02:14.980
So what else could I even give her?

02:22.340 --> 02:23.120
Take it.

02:24.150 --> 02:24.950
Your safety is

02:25.210 --> 02:26.740
the best gift I can give her.

02:27.750 --> 02:28.630
This is His Highness's gift for you.

02:28.630 --> 02:29.590
I can't accept it.

02:29.590 --> 02:30.880
What use is it to me?

02:31.150 --> 02:33.090
My father was imprisoned,
and I almost got killed as well.

02:33.090 --> 02:34.690
Could this possibly save me?

02:35.000 --> 02:36.000
But you can keep it

02:36.560 --> 02:38.750
and occasionally recall
the title of "princess"

02:38.750 --> 02:39.630
just for fun.

02:40.280 --> 02:40.910
I

02:41.590 --> 02:42.720
won't keep any more.

02:44.720 --> 02:45.750
Will you continue to help Mr. Chang

02:45.750 --> 02:46.880
with the horse gang?

02:47.520 --> 02:48.150
Of course.

02:48.560 --> 02:50.310
We stick to our own world.

02:52.910 --> 02:53.710
Then you

02:55.120 --> 02:56.579
take care on your journey.

03:03.190 --> 03:03.870
Gu.

03:05.160 --> 03:06.080
This past year,

03:06.960 --> 03:08.620
I've been reading some books.

03:10.080 --> 03:13.320
Father and I have been
on the move everywhere since I was little,

03:13.320 --> 03:15.720
but I never learned
to speak like a scholar.

03:15.910 --> 03:17.110
That doesn't matter.

03:17.750 --> 03:19.750
The chivalrous are often the humble,

03:19.750 --> 03:22.010
while the heartless are often scholars.

03:24.730 --> 03:26.470
That's the fault of the heartless person,

03:26.470 --> 03:27.630
not the books.

03:29.500 --> 03:31.079
I read in books

03:31.810 --> 03:33.630
that when scholars bid farewell,

03:33.630 --> 03:35.890
they always compose and exchange poems.

03:38.280 --> 03:39.400
Let me recite a poem

03:39.870 --> 03:41.800
I read this morning to send you off.

03:49.910 --> 03:51.240
"Gloomy winds and rain;

03:52.260 --> 03:53.920
roosters crow without cease.

03:57.000 --> 03:58.329
Having met you, my dear.

04:00.800 --> 04:02.260
I couldn't rejoice more."

04:03.280 --> 04:06.870
♪ Names being etched
and centered in the time ♪

04:07.320 --> 04:10.560
♪ A goose flying across the barren plains,
carrying the setting sun's last light ♪

04:09.090 --> 04:09.800
Gu.

04:11.220 --> 04:11.900
Take care.

04:11.420 --> 04:18.730
♪ An old friend suddenly comes to mind,
and the world feels vast and desolate ♪

04:19.519 --> 04:22.730
♪ Here, I dreamed of you ♪

04:23.430 --> 04:26.600
♪ The candlelight casts the glow on me ♪

04:27.430 --> 04:35.400
♪ The rain soaks the paper umbrella;
the red mark on my sleeve spreads ♪

04:36.090 --> 04:38.980
♪ Ride home on horseback ♪

04:56.159 --> 05:02.930
♪ The wind brushes past the old eaves
on a cool night ♪

05:03.790 --> 05:10.150
♪ Look, the lanterns sway and cast shadow
of our overlapping silhouettes ♪

05:10.930 --> 05:19.340
♪ Forget about how long the path is ♪

05:18.000 --> 05:19.800
Are you an official or a soldier?

05:21.060 --> 05:26.340
♪ This is etched into my soul,
unforgettable for life ♪

05:21.820 --> 05:22.870
I am a convict.

05:23.890 --> 05:25.090
You're a good person.

05:25.360 --> 05:26.680
May heaven bless you.

05:26.700 --> 05:27.630
You'll get to the bottom of this.

05:26.800 --> 05:30.260
♪ Names being etched
and centered in the time ♪

05:27.720 --> 05:28.750
You won't stay wrongly accused

05:28.750 --> 05:30.370
your whole life without answers.

05:30.370 --> 05:31.450
If I beg your father

05:30.840 --> 05:34.210
♪ A goose flying across the barren plains,
carrying the setting sun's last light ♪

05:31.610 --> 05:32.560
to take me as his student

05:32.560 --> 05:33.940
and teach me about business...

05:33.940 --> 05:34.920
If he won't teach you,

05:34.920 --> 05:35.800
I can!

05:35.020 --> 05:42.480
♪ The rain soaks the paper umbrella;
the red mark on my sleeve spreads ♪

05:41.680 --> 05:42.560
Gu.

05:43.100 --> 05:46.140
♪ My heart races so fast
like a surging sea ♪

05:43.490 --> 05:44.480
Our lives are

05:44.500 --> 05:45.830
tied together.

05:46.950 --> 05:50.560
♪ Longing sweeps through like starlight ♪

05:51.450 --> 05:59.330
♪ Even when hair turns grey, we'll still
gaze at each other, fingers entwined ♪

06:00.060 --> 06:03.000
♪ The Milky Way spans the west window ♪

06:39.000 --> 06:39.600
Everyone.

06:39.870 --> 06:40.950
My home is just up ahead.

06:40.950 --> 06:42.480
Come with me to the village.

06:44.240 --> 06:45.100
Your Highness,

06:45.720 --> 06:47.290
we were ordered
to escort you only this far.

06:47.290 --> 06:48.240
From here on, you'll walk

06:48.240 --> 06:49.830
the rest of the path yourself.

06:49.830 --> 06:50.570
Farewell.

06:50.590 --> 06:51.590
How could that be?

06:52.040 --> 06:52.950
You've worked hard escorting me

06:52.950 --> 06:53.680
all this way.

06:53.950 --> 06:55.560
You must at least come with me for a meal.

06:55.560 --> 06:56.470
We're bound by military orders

06:56.470 --> 06:57.720
that we dare not disobey.

06:57.720 --> 06:59.650
Your Highness, please say no more.

07:02.510 --> 07:03.160
Someday,

07:03.600 --> 07:05.580
when you and the Princess
return to Horqin,

07:05.580 --> 07:07.240
I will serve you drinks again.

07:08.000 --> 07:08.560
Let's go.

07:27.300 --> 07:29.890
[Shanjian Village, Huizhou]

08:09.740 --> 08:12.590
[Gu's Mansion]

09:46.440 --> 09:47.080
Mother.

09:56.180 --> 09:56.730
Mother.

09:57.570 --> 10:01.050
[Mrs. Gu, Mother of Gu Pingyuan]

10:18.030 --> 10:18.670
Mother.

10:20.810 --> 10:21.610
I'm Pingyuan.

10:22.840 --> 10:23.790
Your son.

10:25.040 --> 10:26.370
I, your son, am back.

10:31.930 --> 10:32.630
Mother!

10:40.840 --> 10:42.080
Pingyuan!

10:43.310 --> 10:44.390
Is it really you?

10:44.500 --> 10:46.200
My son is back!

10:46.340 --> 10:48.550
You are my firstborn son.

10:48.570 --> 10:49.570
Pingyuan.

10:51.030 --> 10:52.390
God is merciful.

10:52.440 --> 10:53.720
God showed mercy!

10:56.080 --> 10:57.440
God let us, mother and son,

10:57.440 --> 10:59.510
reunite while still alive!

11:03.480 --> 11:05.770
Pingyuan, let me look at you.

11:05.870 --> 11:06.550
My son,

11:06.550 --> 11:08.840
I've nearly cried my eyes blind.

11:08.840 --> 11:09.600
My son.

11:11.240 --> 11:12.810
I've been waiting...

11:12.960 --> 11:15.550
I've been waiting for your return.

11:20.200 --> 11:21.150
My son.

11:35.360 --> 11:37.320
My son.

11:42.000 --> 11:43.550
My son.

11:58.150 --> 12:00.150
We've literally had the worst luck.

12:00.670 --> 12:02.130
What kind of world is this?

12:03.240 --> 12:05.570
It's always the common people who suffer.

12:18.960 --> 12:19.480
What...

12:26.150 --> 12:26.840
Pingwen.

12:28.560 --> 12:29.760
You've grown taller.

12:30.370 --> 12:33.130
[Gu Pingwen, the Gu Family's Second Son]

12:33.720 --> 12:35.050
Don't you recognize me?

12:35.840 --> 12:36.390
Get up.

12:55.440 --> 12:56.000
Brother.

12:57.870 --> 12:59.080
Now you know I'm your brother?

12:59.080 --> 13:00.210
You hit way too hard!

13:05.570 --> 13:06.980
You've finally come back!

13:06.980 --> 13:07.480
We thought

13:07.480 --> 13:08.620
you were dead all these years!

13:08.620 --> 13:09.200
I had to do

13:09.200 --> 13:10.460
all the work by myself.

13:37.510 --> 13:40.800
[Gu's Mansion]

13:39.870 --> 13:41.400
Mother's eyes are like this

13:41.510 --> 13:42.510
because she's cried too much

13:42.510 --> 13:43.640
and too frequently.

13:44.550 --> 13:45.750
Now that you're back,

13:45.870 --> 13:47.870
she'll surely get better day by day.

13:51.400 --> 13:51.870
I remember

13:51.870 --> 13:53.800
that when you were just taken away,

13:54.000 --> 13:55.530
I always saw Mother crying.

13:59.360 --> 14:00.200
Back then, Mr. Bai

14:00.200 --> 14:01.120
would occasionally come

14:01.120 --> 14:02.250
to talk with Mother.

14:02.960 --> 14:04.820
Later, he had difficulty walking

14:05.000 --> 14:06.130
and stopped coming.

14:06.790 --> 14:08.910
I still had to work in the fields

14:10.030 --> 14:12.960
while there was no one
to keep Mother company at home.

14:13.790 --> 14:15.080
I'm not a child.

14:15.270 --> 14:16.720
Why would I need company?

14:19.200 --> 14:21.000
Even if I go completely blind,

14:21.430 --> 14:22.760
I can still spin thread.

14:23.480 --> 14:24.210
That's true.

14:24.630 --> 14:26.440
Despite Mother's poor eyesight,

14:26.440 --> 14:28.090
the thread she spins is

14:28.320 --> 14:29.630
so fine and delicate

14:29.750 --> 14:31.750
that even young girls can't make it.

14:32.260 --> 14:33.320
What about Mr. Bai?

14:33.630 --> 14:34.690
Besides his leg problem,

14:34.690 --> 14:35.840
what else is wrong with him?

14:35.840 --> 14:36.910
His legs have a problem,

14:36.910 --> 14:37.910
and his temper is even worse.

14:37.910 --> 14:38.940
He always yells at people

14:38.940 --> 14:39.670
like me.

14:40.910 --> 14:42.310
I'll take you to see him tomorrow.

14:42.310 --> 14:43.440
But I'm not going in.

14:43.500 --> 14:44.910
I don't want to be scolded again.

14:44.910 --> 14:46.040
His bad temper isn't

14:46.080 --> 14:47.320
anything new.

14:47.960 --> 14:49.560
I remember when I was little,

14:50.000 --> 14:51.440
if I couldn't recite the articles,

14:51.440 --> 14:52.630
he would hit my palms,

14:52.630 --> 14:54.200
making my hands swell.

14:54.670 --> 14:55.910
If I have to name someone

14:55.910 --> 14:56.640
in this world

14:56.720 --> 14:58.080
who makes my legs tremble
just by seeing them,

14:58.080 --> 14:59.810
it would definitely be Mr. Bai.

15:01.200 --> 15:02.390
You got off easy.

15:02.720 --> 15:03.600
Back in my day,

15:03.840 --> 15:05.030
he hit my hands

15:05.160 --> 15:07.750
and twisted my ears,
which ended up like Buddha's long ears.

15:07.750 --> 15:09.160
That was what you get
for not studying hard.

15:09.160 --> 15:10.220
If you were like me,

15:10.320 --> 15:11.320
reciting articles well,

15:11.320 --> 15:13.720
you could even stay
for dinner at his house.

15:14.150 --> 15:15.440
If I had Miss Bai

15:15.480 --> 15:16.480
studying with me,

15:16.840 --> 15:18.700
I would have done better than you.

15:33.360 --> 15:34.000
Well,

15:34.960 --> 15:36.020
how is Yimei doing?

15:36.840 --> 15:37.790
Has she

15:38.970 --> 15:40.370
gotten married already?

15:41.550 --> 15:42.200
No.

15:47.440 --> 15:48.320
I know.

15:49.200 --> 15:50.080
I made her

15:50.960 --> 15:52.490
wait for me all these years.

15:52.870 --> 15:53.800
She's suffered.

15:54.120 --> 15:54.630
So,

15:55.200 --> 15:56.480
first thing tomorrow morning,

15:56.480 --> 15:57.610
I'll go visit Mr. Bai

15:57.870 --> 15:59.440
and apologize to him in person.

15:59.440 --> 16:00.630
Whether he beats me up

16:00.630 --> 16:01.670
or scolds me,

16:01.840 --> 16:04.040
at least it makes me feel better inside.

16:10.220 --> 16:10.820
By the way,

16:11.790 --> 16:12.960
on my way back,

16:13.000 --> 16:14.120
I saw some burned tea plants

16:14.120 --> 16:15.380
in the tea plantation.

16:15.480 --> 16:16.340
What happened?

16:18.910 --> 16:19.840
Tell him.

16:21.080 --> 16:22.240
Otherwise, your brother

16:22.240 --> 16:23.200
won't eat

16:23.320 --> 16:24.480
or sleep well.

16:27.000 --> 16:27.840
Last month,

16:28.320 --> 16:29.910
soldiers fought a battle here.

16:29.910 --> 16:31.630
So the tea plantation was burned.

16:31.630 --> 16:33.080
Qimen was besieged, too.

16:34.480 --> 16:35.720
And Miss Bai was taken away

16:35.720 --> 16:36.920
by the southern army.

16:37.870 --> 16:39.070
In the whole village,

16:39.840 --> 16:41.960
except for little girls and elderly women,

16:41.960 --> 16:42.960
all women who could work were

16:42.960 --> 16:43.910
taken away.

16:44.720 --> 16:47.320
They said
it was to look after wounded soldiers

16:47.510 --> 16:48.510
and do laundry.

16:48.720 --> 16:50.670
They promised to release them in 10 days,

16:50.670 --> 16:52.070
but it's been a month now.

16:54.150 --> 16:55.750
These days,
people in the village are saying

16:55.750 --> 16:57.080
that we should select someone

16:57.080 --> 16:58.540
to go demand their return.

16:59.080 --> 17:00.140
But we can't get in.

17:00.840 --> 17:02.770
We would be driven away at the gate.

17:02.840 --> 17:03.960
They have all kinds of weapons,

17:03.960 --> 17:05.480
like swords, guns, spears, and axes.

17:05.480 --> 17:07.410
Are we throwing ourselves at them?

17:08.880 --> 17:10.410
Do you know which army it is?

17:10.680 --> 17:13.109
It's said to be
the Resistance Army from Guangxi.

17:13.109 --> 17:15.170
They're led by a general surnamed Li.

17:15.550 --> 17:16.750
He's quite formidable.

17:16.750 --> 17:18.950
They're even planning to attack Hefei.

17:19.200 --> 17:20.200
So, when is our village

17:20.200 --> 17:21.440
planning to ask for our people back?

17:21.440 --> 17:23.000
I already told you.

17:23.160 --> 17:24.270
We can't get through the camp entrance.

17:24.270 --> 17:25.680
Who would dare to force their way in?

17:25.680 --> 17:26.410
No one dares.

17:28.590 --> 17:29.990
Yimei has been captured.

17:30.960 --> 17:32.070
Then Mr. Bai...

17:34.480 --> 17:35.160
Pingyuan,

17:35.940 --> 17:37.670
you should go see him tomorrow.

17:38.350 --> 17:40.280
All these years, it's been Pingwen

17:40.350 --> 17:42.030
delivering firewood and water

17:42.030 --> 17:42.830
to their home.

17:44.110 --> 17:45.970
Yimei's life hanging by a thread,

17:46.790 --> 17:48.180
Mr. Bai must be

17:48.480 --> 17:49.880
as worried as I used to be.

17:58.400 --> 17:58.960
Mother,

17:59.550 --> 18:00.510
don't think too much.

18:00.510 --> 18:01.710
Let's enjoy our meal.

18:07.470 --> 18:08.790
Now that I'm back,

18:10.150 --> 18:11.950
I won't be away for so long again.

18:13.600 --> 18:14.830
This war will eventually

18:14.830 --> 18:16.030
come to an end one day.

18:16.200 --> 18:17.960
And I think that day will soon come.

18:17.960 --> 18:19.090
Once the war is over,

18:19.680 --> 18:20.270
Pingwen and I will

18:20.270 --> 18:21.730
fix up the tea plantation.

18:22.160 --> 18:23.610
We'll continue selling our tea,

18:23.610 --> 18:24.870
run our business well,

18:24.920 --> 18:26.050
and live a good life.

18:27.160 --> 18:27.640
Mother,

18:28.000 --> 18:29.140
don't worry too much.

18:29.140 --> 18:30.510
Your health comes first.

18:30.510 --> 18:32.120
Our good days are yet to come.

18:32.350 --> 18:34.280
Don't fall ill or get into trouble.

18:41.830 --> 18:42.550
I once heard

18:42.550 --> 18:44.440
these words in my dreams.

18:46.350 --> 18:49.030
Now I can hear you say them in person.

18:51.530 --> 18:52.950
Even if I were to die right now,

18:52.950 --> 18:54.080
it would be worth it.

19:10.110 --> 19:10.720
Pingyuan,

19:11.400 --> 19:13.470
I don't remember seeing you
carry a shoulder pole before.

19:13.470 --> 19:14.930
You're doing pretty well.

19:15.060 --> 19:17.030
I used to think of myself as a scholar.

19:17.030 --> 19:18.520
Why would I need to carry firewood?

19:18.520 --> 19:19.780
But later in Ningguta,

19:19.890 --> 19:20.880
I hunted tigers in the mountains

19:20.880 --> 19:22.350
and panned for gold in the rivers.

19:22.350 --> 19:23.160
Carrying a shoulder pole?

19:23.160 --> 19:24.420
That's a piece of cake.

19:27.680 --> 19:28.440
Mr. Bai,

19:29.070 --> 19:30.130
I, Pingwen, am here

19:30.240 --> 19:32.510
to bring you water and firewood.

19:38.880 --> 19:40.480
Carrying water and delivering firewood are

19:40.480 --> 19:42.070
two jobs.

19:42.590 --> 19:44.920
What do you mean
by "bring you water and firewood"?

19:44.920 --> 19:46.920
Do you have multiple heads and arms?

19:47.400 --> 19:48.310
Did you hear that, Pingyuan?

19:48.310 --> 19:49.350
How nitpicky he is.

19:49.350 --> 19:50.890
This isn't nitpicking.

19:52.200 --> 19:54.130
Incorrect names lead to discrepancies
between words and truths.

19:54.130 --> 19:55.720
And with these discrepancies,
things won't make sense.

19:55.720 --> 19:58.010
If things won't make sense,
nothing can be accomplished.

19:58.010 --> 19:59.200
Didn't I teach you this

19:59.200 --> 20:00.640
when you were a student?

20:04.200 --> 20:04.720
Mr. Bai,

20:04.720 --> 20:05.850
I-I'll be going now.

20:14.480 --> 20:15.070
Mr. Bai.

20:15.640 --> 20:18.390
[Bai Shi'an, Private School Teacher]

20:21.240 --> 20:22.970
I'm your student, Gu Pingyuan.

20:23.030 --> 20:23.640
I'm back

20:24.930 --> 20:25.740
to greet you.

20:33.110 --> 20:34.750
P-Pingyuan, you're back?

20:37.510 --> 20:38.590
Pingyuan!

20:45.940 --> 20:47.380
You rascal.

20:52.830 --> 20:54.000
You little rascal.

20:57.790 --> 20:58.400
I...

21:00.030 --> 21:02.000
You made us worried sick about you.

21:02.680 --> 21:03.750
Do you know that?

21:10.950 --> 21:11.590
Good.

21:12.710 --> 21:13.200
Come on.

21:13.220 --> 21:14.200
Get up now.

21:14.240 --> 21:15.110
Get up quickly.

21:15.830 --> 21:16.610
Alright, let's...

21:16.610 --> 21:17.750
L-Let's go inside

21:17.930 --> 21:19.540
to have a nice chat.

21:26.270 --> 21:27.470
Come inside quickly.

21:30.340 --> 21:33.500
[A long journey
with heavy responsibilities]

21:31.350 --> 21:32.510
Come on in.

21:39.880 --> 21:40.480
Mr. Bai,

21:41.110 --> 21:42.920
your place hasn't changed at all.

21:42.920 --> 21:43.720
That's great.

21:45.550 --> 21:46.880
What's so good about it?

21:48.790 --> 21:50.310
I remember back then,

21:50.310 --> 21:51.840
seeing that I was too small,

21:51.880 --> 21:53.340
you let me sit in the front.

21:53.550 --> 21:54.210
Right here.

21:54.680 --> 21:55.310
At that time, my feet

21:55.310 --> 21:57.110
couldn't even touch the ground.

21:58.330 --> 21:59.070
You squatted

21:59.070 --> 22:00.590
by my wall to eavesdrop every day,

22:00.590 --> 22:01.920
fell asleep halfway through,

22:01.920 --> 22:02.850
and even snored.

22:03.120 --> 22:04.200
I kept wondering

22:04.790 --> 22:06.920
if my teaching was really that boring.

22:07.200 --> 22:08.720
The sunshine was so comfortable back then.

22:08.720 --> 22:09.510
Once I basked in the sun,

22:09.510 --> 22:10.970
I'd fall asleep in no time.

22:15.110 --> 22:16.710
Did you come back yesterday?

22:17.120 --> 22:18.790
My mother told me that you've been

22:18.790 --> 22:20.520
having trouble with your legs.

22:20.590 --> 22:21.450
She asked Pingwen and me

22:21.450 --> 22:23.510
to come visit you early this morning.

22:24.830 --> 22:26.640
Is your mother feeling better?

22:28.190 --> 22:29.510
Last night, when she saw me

22:29.510 --> 22:30.830
and we talked for a while,

22:30.830 --> 22:32.630
her eyes seemed to light up a bit.

22:35.790 --> 22:36.720
I've failed to be

22:37.000 --> 22:38.460
a good son all these years.

22:41.440 --> 22:43.000
Someone set you up
in the examination site.

22:43.000 --> 22:46.060
Guess it was a tribulation
you were destined to suffer.

22:46.510 --> 22:47.570
Being back today is

22:48.110 --> 22:49.640
a blessing in and of itself.

22:54.640 --> 22:55.400
Mr. Bai,

22:56.310 --> 22:57.370
please don't sigh.

22:57.820 --> 22:58.760
I heard

22:59.210 --> 23:01.070
that Yimei was taken away, right?

23:03.720 --> 23:04.680
All the women in the village

23:04.680 --> 23:05.880
have been taken away.

23:05.880 --> 23:07.160
I think they're probably

23:07.160 --> 23:09.270
being made to do sewing and washing work.

23:09.270 --> 23:10.110
Isn't the village just

23:10.110 --> 23:11.240
looking for a representative

23:11.240 --> 23:13.200
to go to the camp
and ask for their return?

23:13.200 --> 23:14.480
I think I can go.

23:18.350 --> 23:19.980
A scholar can't talk sense

23:20.200 --> 23:21.640
into soldiers.

23:22.270 --> 23:23.030
Don't go.

23:23.510 --> 23:25.370
We should choose a smooth talker.

23:26.790 --> 23:27.580
Mr. Bai,

23:28.400 --> 23:29.830
I'm no longer a scholar.

23:30.920 --> 23:32.650
My academic title was revoked.

23:33.270 --> 23:34.240
Now I've got a way

23:34.960 --> 23:35.680
with words.

23:37.140 --> 23:37.790
Trust me.

23:39.350 --> 23:40.550
These past few years,

23:41.440 --> 23:43.000
you've indeed grown a lot.

23:43.720 --> 23:44.790
Once I bring Yimei back,

23:44.790 --> 23:46.250
I'll marry her right away.

23:47.440 --> 23:48.240
Last night with my mother,

23:48.240 --> 23:49.300
I said these words.

23:50.030 --> 23:50.830
Today, facing you, Mr. Bai,

23:50.830 --> 23:51.960
I say the same thing.

23:53.000 --> 23:53.550
Mr. Bai,

23:54.350 --> 23:56.350
you must take good care of yourself.

23:56.550 --> 23:59.680
I still need to take good care of you
as my father-in-law.

24:06.870 --> 24:08.270
If this comes true,

24:15.240 --> 24:17.640
I'd be such a lucky man
in my twilight years!

24:19.790 --> 24:21.110
I have a good student,

24:21.270 --> 24:24.090
an excellent son-in-law,
to bring me joy by my side.

24:24.090 --> 24:25.400
How wonderful.

24:27.040 --> 24:28.610
What a joy.

24:36.640 --> 24:37.240
Pingwen.

24:37.720 --> 24:39.750
Is there any place nearby
that sells hemp ropes?

24:39.750 --> 24:41.310
Hemp ropes? We have some at home.

24:41.310 --> 24:42.760
No, I mean the big kind.

24:42.960 --> 24:44.820
In large bundles. The thick type.

24:46.480 --> 24:48.180
Those villages down there all grow hemp.

24:48.180 --> 24:49.640
You could go look for them.

24:49.750 --> 24:51.210
How much do you want to buy?

24:51.240 --> 24:52.840
About 400 or 500 taels worth.

24:53.000 --> 24:54.200
400 or 500 taels?

24:54.200 --> 24:56.270
That's about several warehouses of hemp!

24:56.270 --> 24:56.800
Exactly.

24:57.070 --> 24:58.000
Is that possible?

24:58.000 --> 24:59.680
Stop bragging, okay?

24:59.850 --> 25:00.880
Even if you have people
from several villages

25:00.880 --> 25:02.000
twist ropes with you

25:02.000 --> 25:02.680
for three years,

25:02.680 --> 25:03.240
you still can't make

25:03.240 --> 25:04.840
ropes worth 400 or 500 taels.

25:05.590 --> 25:06.830
A quick question for you.

25:06.830 --> 25:07.590
Would you like to learn

25:07.590 --> 25:08.850
to do business from me?

25:09.200 --> 25:10.270
I'd like to.

25:10.880 --> 25:12.540
But I only know how to grow tea.

25:13.680 --> 25:14.280
Well then,

25:14.620 --> 25:15.480
from now on,

25:15.480 --> 25:16.680
I'll be your teacher.

25:16.710 --> 25:17.960
Observe carefully when you're with me,

25:17.960 --> 25:18.720
listen closely,

25:18.720 --> 25:20.290
and ask me privately
about anything you don't get.

25:20.290 --> 25:20.890
Remember,

25:21.200 --> 25:22.450
never question

25:22.480 --> 25:24.610
any of my decisions in front of others.

25:38.000 --> 25:38.750
Alright. Have a safe trip, sir.

25:38.750 --> 25:40.480
These are the last two baskets.

25:47.750 --> 25:48.480
How do I look?

25:49.400 --> 25:50.480
Why did you grab

25:50.480 --> 25:51.270
Li's glasses?

25:51.270 --> 25:52.070
I paid!

25:52.440 --> 25:53.450
They'll come in handy.

25:53.450 --> 25:53.910
Let's go

25:54.240 --> 25:55.170
sell hemp ropes.

25:59.470 --> 26:03.160
[The Military Camp of Li Cheng,
Resistance Army]

26:14.720 --> 26:15.380
Stop there!

26:15.710 --> 26:17.240
Where do you think you're trespassing?

26:17.240 --> 26:17.720
Go back!

26:18.830 --> 26:19.400
Go back?

26:20.000 --> 26:21.580
What about my cartload of goods?

26:21.580 --> 26:23.360
Take your things and get lost.

26:23.550 --> 26:25.420
No outsiders are allowed
into the military camp.

26:25.420 --> 26:26.550
Don't you know that?

26:26.880 --> 26:27.510
Young man,

26:28.000 --> 26:29.130
may I have your name?

26:30.120 --> 26:31.070
So when Li Cheng asks me about it,

26:31.070 --> 26:32.030
I can tell him

26:32.550 --> 26:33.880
who drove me away.

26:43.920 --> 26:45.590
If you don't make yourself clear,

26:45.590 --> 26:47.050
how can we let you in?

26:47.200 --> 26:48.270
Our general's orders are

26:48.270 --> 26:49.260
very strict.

26:50.110 --> 26:50.970
Let me tell you.

26:51.630 --> 26:53.960
This cartload of goods is urgent supplies

26:54.110 --> 26:55.830
for your naval forces,

26:56.690 --> 26:58.270
not easy to get these days.

27:00.240 --> 27:01.640
Not letting me in, right?

27:01.900 --> 27:03.100
Fine, we're leaving.

27:03.610 --> 27:05.060
Wait, wait, wait!

27:05.990 --> 27:08.590
Was it really the General
who asked you to come?

27:14.200 --> 27:15.370
Come on, get up here.

27:15.710 --> 27:16.910
I'll take you inside.

27:17.020 --> 27:18.950
You can ask him yourself, alright?

27:18.950 --> 27:20.350
You may go in by yourself.

27:22.050 --> 27:22.830
Listen,

27:23.400 --> 27:24.490
once you enter the camp,

27:24.490 --> 27:25.790
you must get off the wagon

27:25.790 --> 27:26.640
and don't park anywhere.

27:26.640 --> 27:28.000
All forms of driving
and horseback riding are

27:28.000 --> 27:29.330
prohibited in the camp.

27:29.640 --> 27:30.900
Pay attention to this.

27:30.960 --> 27:31.720
Yes, sir.

27:35.400 --> 27:35.880
Come on,

27:36.070 --> 27:36.870
clear the way!

27:56.350 --> 27:57.200
There are two people outside

27:57.200 --> 27:58.350
asking to meet the General.

27:58.350 --> 27:59.350
It's these two, right?

27:59.350 --> 27:59.720
Yes.

28:00.270 --> 28:00.870
You may go.

28:07.830 --> 28:09.830
You're the one
looking for our general, huh?

28:09.830 --> 28:11.430
General Li is busy with work.

28:11.440 --> 28:12.640
Just leave these things

28:12.640 --> 28:13.740
over there and go.

28:13.880 --> 28:15.240
I'll report it to him later.

28:15.240 --> 28:16.200
Go and report

28:16.920 --> 28:17.920
that his cousin,

28:18.410 --> 28:19.610
Gu Pingyuan, is here.

28:21.790 --> 28:22.790
How impertinent!

28:23.270 --> 28:24.110
No matter how busy he is,

28:24.110 --> 28:25.310
how can he not meet me?

28:28.240 --> 28:29.070
Cousin?

28:30.860 --> 28:31.640
So you claim to be

28:31.640 --> 28:33.300
our general's cousin, right?

28:36.590 --> 28:37.720
Go report to him now!

28:37.780 --> 28:38.400
Alright.

28:38.920 --> 28:39.780
How about this?

28:39.960 --> 28:41.160
You go by yourselves.

28:41.260 --> 28:43.010
See that gate ahead?

28:43.350 --> 28:44.080
Go through it

28:44.090 --> 28:45.160
and then go straight.

28:45.160 --> 28:46.240
The large tent up front is

28:46.240 --> 28:48.050
our general's headquarters.

28:49.590 --> 28:50.120
Go ahead.

28:52.550 --> 28:53.150
Off you go.

28:59.580 --> 29:00.780
Take it slow in there.

29:02.240 --> 29:02.790
Go ahead.

29:44.310 --> 29:45.000
Li

29:45.000 --> 29:46.600
leads his troops quite well.

29:47.400 --> 29:49.460
How do you know about leading troops?

29:50.240 --> 29:51.550
Back when I was in Ningguta,

29:51.550 --> 29:53.160
I hung around with the soldiers there

29:53.160 --> 29:54.160
and learned a bit.

29:55.030 --> 29:55.940
I think you've

29:56.050 --> 29:57.650
picked up other skills, too.

29:59.050 --> 29:59.640
What?

30:00.310 --> 30:01.790
Your smooth talk and lies.

30:02.480 --> 30:03.480
How could you be

30:03.550 --> 30:04.770
Li Cheng's cousin?

30:05.240 --> 30:05.920
What will you say

30:05.920 --> 30:07.250
when you meet him later?

30:07.800 --> 30:09.400
I'm just playing it by ear.

30:10.070 --> 30:12.400
How else would we get in without bluffing?

30:31.960 --> 30:33.490
Is General Li Cheng inside?

30:34.160 --> 30:36.360
I, Gu Pingyuan, am seeking an audience.

30:37.070 --> 30:38.600
Is General Li Cheng inside?

30:39.070 --> 30:41.270
I, Gu Pingyuan, am seeking an audience.

30:43.550 --> 30:45.080
Is General Li Cheng inside?

30:47.110 --> 30:48.480
You bluffer.

30:56.270 --> 30:57.240
Cousin?

30:59.910 --> 31:00.770
Take them away.

31:07.920 --> 31:08.580
Do we really

31:08.590 --> 31:09.920
have to besiege Hefei?

31:10.420 --> 31:11.400
The imperial court's army

31:11.400 --> 31:13.390
has already pulled through
the toughest time.

31:13.390 --> 31:15.110
The navy controls
the middle and upper reaches.

31:15.110 --> 31:16.270
Now we still have a chance

31:16.270 --> 31:17.330
to push northward.

31:17.750 --> 31:18.510
If we spend

31:18.550 --> 31:19.510
too much time in Hefei,

31:19.510 --> 31:21.110
it will bring us big trouble!

31:22.270 --> 31:23.240
Do you still remember

31:23.240 --> 31:24.840
the last northern campaign?

31:25.510 --> 31:26.170
Say no more.

31:27.360 --> 31:29.160
We'll follow orders from above.

31:31.440 --> 31:32.550
I'm afraid he only cares

31:32.550 --> 31:33.880
about his Sufu Province

31:34.400 --> 31:35.660
and ignores Tianjing.

31:36.310 --> 31:38.240
Ever since His Lordship passed away,

31:38.240 --> 31:39.440
something feels off.

31:40.160 --> 31:41.690
Forgive me for saying this,

31:41.880 --> 31:43.640
but our situation is deteriorating

31:43.640 --> 31:44.590
day by day.

31:46.200 --> 31:46.730
General,

31:47.530 --> 31:48.460
there's no point

31:48.480 --> 31:49.940
in our staying in Huizhou.

31:50.030 --> 31:52.200
They want us to create a diversion
to support the navy.

31:52.200 --> 31:53.460
With these few troops,

31:53.510 --> 31:54.710
how can we pull it off?

31:55.680 --> 31:57.590
Besides, given Huizhou's low terrain,

31:57.590 --> 31:58.590
we're here just for the imperial court

31:58.590 --> 32:00.050
to have its troops raid us.

32:01.750 --> 32:02.550
With insufficient forces,

32:02.550 --> 32:03.680
a long defense line,

32:03.720 --> 32:05.550
and frequent night attacks from the enemy,

32:05.550 --> 32:06.820
all camps are rattled

32:07.160 --> 32:08.490
in a state of low morale.

32:13.790 --> 32:14.510
Everyone,

32:14.880 --> 32:16.110
you're all my old pals

32:16.110 --> 32:16.910
from Guangxi.

32:18.270 --> 32:20.920
I've joined
the Resistance Army since childhood,

32:20.920 --> 32:23.180
rising from a child soldier to a general.

32:23.270 --> 32:24.510
I clearly remember

32:24.790 --> 32:26.400
that we all swore

32:27.000 --> 32:28.730
to overthrow the Qing Dynasty.

32:29.200 --> 32:31.030
Since we followed the Heavenly King,

32:31.030 --> 32:32.490
kept our hair, and rose up,

32:33.030 --> 32:34.000
we should know

32:34.510 --> 32:35.510
that this is a war to the death

32:35.510 --> 32:36.710
with no turning back.

32:41.750 --> 32:42.280
Alright,

32:42.790 --> 32:43.920
return to your camps

32:44.160 --> 32:45.550
and stabilize the morale.

32:45.550 --> 32:46.350
Furthermore,

32:47.160 --> 32:48.200
don't let me hear of anyone

32:48.200 --> 32:49.800
plundering villages again.

32:50.110 --> 32:50.960
Otherwise,

32:51.270 --> 32:53.030
I'll execute them before reporting

32:53.030 --> 32:53.830
with no mercy.

32:54.400 --> 32:55.200
Yes, General.

33:11.030 --> 33:12.440
Who is that general?

33:15.000 --> 33:17.030
You've claimed to be
my general's cousin for a while.

33:17.030 --> 33:18.830
And you don't even know who he is?

33:19.830 --> 33:20.510
General Li!

33:20.790 --> 33:21.450
General Li!

33:22.510 --> 33:23.570
How stupid you are.

33:24.510 --> 33:26.510
Swaggering into our camp so boldly,

33:26.640 --> 33:28.030
you truly have no regard

33:28.070 --> 33:29.530
for those heroic figures.

33:30.160 --> 33:31.620
I'm just a small merchant.

33:31.920 --> 33:32.850
To seek profits,

33:33.680 --> 33:34.680
I played a trick and accidentally

33:34.680 --> 33:35.740
entered your camp.

33:36.110 --> 33:37.400
Please forgive me, General.

33:37.400 --> 33:38.590
A small merchant?

33:38.920 --> 33:39.720
You're lying!

33:40.240 --> 33:41.370
Who on earth are you?

33:44.160 --> 33:44.790
Where's my brother?

33:44.790 --> 33:45.480
Your brother?

33:45.480 --> 33:46.550
Your brother is dead because of you.

33:46.550 --> 33:47.480
Your brother...

33:51.460 --> 33:53.590
General Li, you lead the army
in a disciplined way,

33:53.590 --> 33:55.200
and you don't look like someone
who kills innocents.

33:55.200 --> 33:57.060
I just want to make a deal with you.

33:57.070 --> 33:58.530
Will you let me up, please?

34:05.370 --> 34:06.030
Make a deal?

34:08.449 --> 34:11.860
[Li Cheng, General of the Resistance Army]

34:09.790 --> 34:10.670
What deal?

34:11.960 --> 34:12.560
Did you see

34:12.590 --> 34:14.050
my cart full of hemp ropes?

34:14.280 --> 34:15.440
I know your navy

34:15.440 --> 34:16.670
needs a large quantity of hemp ropes

34:16.670 --> 34:18.000
to reinforce the ships.

34:18.320 --> 34:19.230
People in Huizhou

34:19.230 --> 34:20.480
dare not sell any to you.

34:20.480 --> 34:22.540
I can help you purchase what you need.

34:25.150 --> 34:26.080
Does he look like

34:26.110 --> 34:27.909
a spy sent by the imperial court?

34:30.760 --> 34:31.489
Yes, he does.

34:31.510 --> 34:32.190
No, I don't.

34:32.840 --> 34:33.230
I...

34:34.030 --> 34:35.000
About 25 kilometers from here,

34:35.000 --> 34:36.280
there's Shanjian Village.

34:36.280 --> 34:36.739
You took

34:36.760 --> 34:37.880
all the women here

34:37.960 --> 34:39.020
from that village,

34:39.670 --> 34:40.800
saying that you would

34:40.800 --> 34:41.960
return them in 10 days.

34:41.960 --> 34:43.070
It's been a month now,

34:43.070 --> 34:44.150
and there's been no news at all.

34:44.150 --> 34:45.409
I'm from that village.

34:45.860 --> 34:46.860
What's your name?

34:46.880 --> 34:48.110
My name is Gu Pingyuan.

34:48.110 --> 34:50.340
I've lived in Shanjian Village
since childhood.

34:50.340 --> 34:51.920
I have a teacher surnamed Bai.

34:51.920 --> 34:53.630
His daughter is called Bai Yimei.

34:53.630 --> 34:54.510
"Mei" as in plum blossom.

34:54.510 --> 34:55.920
She should be in your military camp now.

34:55.920 --> 34:56.719
You can ask her

34:57.070 --> 34:57.670
about me.

35:00.670 --> 35:02.330
Continue with the hemp ropes.

35:08.320 --> 35:09.320
I know you need

35:09.320 --> 35:10.550
a whole lot of hemp ropes.

35:10.550 --> 35:11.630
The people in the village might

35:11.630 --> 35:12.430
not be enough.

35:12.760 --> 35:14.130
All these women can twist ropes.

35:14.130 --> 35:15.110
Letting them back

35:15.110 --> 35:16.640
can work in your favor, too.

35:17.400 --> 35:19.170
I have so many wounded soldiers.

35:19.170 --> 35:21.630
Who will take care of them
if the women leave?

35:22.360 --> 35:23.000
General,

35:23.760 --> 35:25.290
forgive me for being blunt.

35:25.800 --> 35:26.360
You won't be able

35:26.360 --> 35:27.760
to stay here much longer.

35:28.000 --> 35:29.460
Those women are innocent.

35:29.710 --> 35:31.310
I don't want them to die here.

35:31.960 --> 35:32.960
Who told you

35:33.000 --> 35:34.680
that I won't be staying here long?

35:34.680 --> 35:35.550
You've been besieging Hefei

35:35.550 --> 35:36.550
for over 2 months.

35:37.480 --> 35:39.110
Yet you still haven't taken it.

35:39.110 --> 35:40.540
Once the imperial court's troops arrive,

35:40.540 --> 35:42.000
they'll surround you completely.

35:42.000 --> 35:43.460
Watch what you're saying!

35:44.910 --> 35:45.570
General Li,

35:46.840 --> 35:48.240
I just have one question.

35:49.510 --> 35:50.840
Have you already killed

35:52.030 --> 35:53.960
those women who were brought here?

35:56.030 --> 35:56.760
If so,

35:56.800 --> 35:58.530
just give me a straight answer.

35:58.590 --> 36:00.990
So I can go back to the village
with the news.

36:02.030 --> 36:03.080
Untie his feet.

36:03.280 --> 36:04.080
Bring him out.

36:04.480 --> 36:05.280
Yes, General.

36:06.230 --> 36:06.690
Come on.

36:24.070 --> 36:24.870
Open the door.

36:45.480 --> 36:46.190
See?

36:46.670 --> 36:47.510
In our Resistance Army,

36:47.510 --> 36:49.770
we have separate camps for men and women.

36:50.480 --> 36:53.010
Even married couples
must sleep separately.

36:53.340 --> 36:54.550
We lead our troops differently

36:54.550 --> 36:55.880
from those brutal guys.

36:56.320 --> 36:58.000
For the poor things in the world,

36:58.000 --> 36:59.400
we treat men like our brothers

36:59.400 --> 37:00.930
and women like our sisters.

37:01.190 --> 37:01.760
Our Resistance Army

37:01.760 --> 37:03.220
will never mistreat them.

37:05.030 --> 37:05.960
See clearly now?

37:06.230 --> 37:07.690
If you do, then just leave.

37:07.750 --> 37:08.550
Get these two brothers

37:08.550 --> 37:09.250
out of the camp.

37:09.250 --> 37:09.980
Understood.

37:10.360 --> 37:10.710
Go.

37:11.880 --> 37:12.320
Go!

37:16.590 --> 37:17.400
Night raid!

37:17.840 --> 37:19.100
Form ranks for battle!

37:27.670 --> 37:28.400
Charge!

37:28.630 --> 37:29.670
Kill them!

37:44.950 --> 37:45.630
Yimei.

37:47.800 --> 37:48.630
Yimei!

37:50.280 --> 37:51.030
Yimei!

37:51.920 --> 37:52.670
Yimei!

38:07.230 --> 38:07.800
Yimei!

38:08.400 --> 38:09.000
Yimei.

38:13.400 --> 38:14.070
Yimei!

38:18.710 --> 38:19.320
Yimei!

38:20.030 --> 38:21.000
Yimei!

38:23.440 --> 38:24.030
Yimei!

38:26.280 --> 38:26.960
Yimei!

38:29.190 --> 38:29.960
Yimei!

38:31.140 --> 38:31.880
Gu!

38:36.320 --> 38:37.070
Gu!

38:40.480 --> 38:41.400
Gu!

38:47.510 --> 38:48.360
Gu!

38:54.360 --> 38:55.030
Gu!

38:56.030 --> 38:56.590
Yimei.

39:01.110 --> 39:01.670
Yimei.

39:05.810 --> 39:06.740
It really is you.

39:08.290 --> 39:09.160
Did you get hurt?

39:08.690 --> 39:10.840
[Bai Yimei, Daughter of Bai Shi'an]

39:11.360 --> 39:13.760
Where are the other women
from our village?

39:14.070 --> 39:16.330
They scattered when the firing started.

39:18.710 --> 39:19.950
Quickly, come with me.

39:19.950 --> 39:20.440
No.

39:20.550 --> 39:22.110
These two were wounded by arrows.

39:22.110 --> 39:24.040
They need water every few minutes.

39:24.670 --> 39:26.470
At a time like this, you still...

39:27.500 --> 39:28.800
Then help me first.

39:44.110 --> 39:45.030
Move aside!

39:45.480 --> 39:46.510
Get out of the way!

39:46.590 --> 39:47.510
Move!

39:49.400 --> 39:50.420
Fire!

40:02.150 --> 40:02.680
Pingwen?

40:03.230 --> 40:03.840
Save me!

40:04.320 --> 40:05.590
Help! Help me!

40:05.670 --> 40:06.360
Help!

40:09.920 --> 40:10.790
It's on fire!

40:12.800 --> 40:13.920
Untie them all.

40:14.000 --> 40:15.150
I'll go find the other women.

40:15.150 --> 40:15.670
Okay.

40:15.920 --> 40:16.630
Help me!

40:17.410 --> 40:18.280
Okay.

40:19.140 --> 40:20.470
I'll help you one by one.

40:21.800 --> 40:23.400
Anyone from Shanjian Village?

40:23.400 --> 40:25.190
Is there anyone from Shanjian Village?

40:25.190 --> 40:27.030
Those from Shanjian Village, follow me!

40:27.030 --> 40:28.710
Anyone from Shanjian Village?

40:28.710 --> 40:29.310
Pingyuan!

40:29.800 --> 40:30.400
Pingyuan.

40:31.000 --> 40:31.530
Pingwen.

40:32.400 --> 40:33.450
Yimei is still in the hut.

40:33.450 --> 40:34.320
Let's hurry inside!

40:34.320 --> 40:34.710
Okay.

40:35.800 --> 40:36.230
Yimei!

40:37.530 --> 40:38.030
Yimei!

40:38.670 --> 40:39.320
No time to waste!

40:39.320 --> 40:39.920
Let's run.

40:40.400 --> 40:41.080
Be careful.

40:48.590 --> 40:49.500
Fall back!

40:49.760 --> 40:50.630
Fall back!

40:50.920 --> 40:51.800
Go back!

40:52.480 --> 40:53.360
Go back!

40:53.710 --> 40:54.590
Fall back!

40:55.030 --> 40:55.920
Back off!

40:56.110 --> 40:57.000
Fall back!

40:57.190 --> 40:57.920
Fall back!

41:11.230 --> 41:12.320
-Back off!
-Go back!

41:12.320 --> 41:13.030
Fall back!

41:13.760 --> 41:14.640
You!

41:14.710 --> 41:15.480
Get back!

41:29.920 --> 41:31.720
Pingyuan! Pingyuan! Pingyuan!

41:33.710 --> 41:34.580
Gu!

41:34.960 --> 41:35.880
Gu!

42:22.110 --> 42:23.110
Let me go!

42:23.400 --> 42:24.320
Let go of me!

42:26.360 --> 42:27.760
What are you waiting for?

42:28.150 --> 42:30.010
There must be a snitch among them!

42:30.800 --> 42:32.130
The General is injured.

42:32.200 --> 42:33.530
Check every one of them!

42:34.930 --> 42:35.420
Si,

42:35.800 --> 42:37.200
go check on the medic now.

42:38.070 --> 42:38.910
I can help.

42:39.230 --> 42:41.320
I know how to treat patients! Let me help!

42:41.320 --> 42:42.380
Don't hurt anyone!

42:42.550 --> 42:43.190
Stop!

42:44.530 --> 42:45.530
Who just spoke?

42:51.920 --> 42:52.320
Me.

42:53.710 --> 42:54.240
It was me.

42:55.190 --> 42:55.920
I beg you.

42:55.940 --> 42:57.720
P-Please don't hurt anyone.

42:58.870 --> 43:01.030
I-I've studied medicine since childhood.

43:01.030 --> 43:01.590
I...
